The engine emits check ids and evidence only. The words a reader sees for each
check (its title, the section of the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023
or the rule of the Digital Personal Data Protection Rules, 2025 it engages, its
label and its fix) live in the StateCheck Security website's catalogue and are
reviewed there. Nothing this software produces is legal advice.

The tracker, consent-platform and vendor-country lists in src/data/ are kept by
hand by StateCheck Security from the vendors' own published pages. They do not
include, and are not derived from, DuckDuckGo Tracker Radar, the Disconnect
list or the Ghostery tracker database.
